{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122230030972-1122_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261122230030\"/><p>意大利允使用Tesla輔助駕駛系統。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>意大利交通部上周五（20日）宣布，批准境內使用美國電動車巨頭Tesla輔助駕駛系統。許可有效期至2029年4月，成為歐盟四大人口最多國家中首個放行的國家。</p><p>系統可在市區自動轉向、轉線及通過迴旋處。Tesla發布影片，展示車輛在羅馬鬥獸場附近自行行駛。不過，意大利交通部強調司機仍須雙手握住軚盤，隨時準備接管車輛。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:23:50.856392+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T15:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:37:47.916488+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T15:17:24.165005+00:00","content_hash":"bc476808c5beaebf5006ff6167f1d6804bcff54172b41c4d37cdba2af16010d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}